ed_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Sorry to review again, but I'm starting to think we might want to reverse this to be `force_disable_specular_occlusion`. \r\n\r\nRight now `enabled` means \"enabled by default, but can be turned off on a case-by-case basis. While \"disabled\" means \"force disabled, can't be enabled\". So implicitly it acts as a force disable rather than something to enable/disable. \r\n\r\nWhat do you think?","created_at":"2025-05-08T17:27:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T17:27:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145#discussion_r2080150273","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2080150273"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145#discussion_r2080150273"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2080150273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3098,"original_line":3098,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2080303282","pull_request_review_id":2826101104,"id":2080303282,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc57_uiy","diff_hunk":"@@ -3095,6 +3095,9 @@\n \t\t<member name=\"rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections.mobile\" type=\"bool\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\" default=\"false\">\n \t\t\tLower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver support.\n \t\t</member>\n+\t\t<member name=\"rendering/reflections/specular_occlusion/enabled\" type=\"bool\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\" default=\"true\">","path":"doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml","commit_id":"56730d0cb2e4fd06c0ef23c7e44d8e9e8e64edf0","original_commit_id":"a17b656e427744672b994c4e24edafd3ffad37b5","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"No worries! :)\r\nFrom the user perspective (Which I think is what matters most here) it's just a toggle of the feature, if it's not enabled the feature isn't active as a whole (and you cannot enable it on a case-by-case basis). We see the same behavior for things like fog, where you can enable fog and still choose to disable it for individual shaders.\r\n\r\nContextualizing a feature toggle as a force disable to the user end seems a little backwards to me. I feel like it _could_ add an implicit connotation that this is not something you'd want to disable, while it's completely fine to do so.\r\n\r\nI'd be in favor of keeping it as an `enabled` checkbox, to me it seems like it'd make the most sense/be the most straightforward from the user's perspective.","created_at":"2025-05-08T18:58:02Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T18:58:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145#discussion_r2080303282","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2080303282"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145#discussion_r2080303282"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2080303282/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3098,"original_line":3098,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2080150273,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2080443942","pull_request_review_id":2826331709,"id":2080443942,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58AQ4m","diff_hunk":"@@ -3095,6 +3095,9 @@\n \t\t<member name=\"rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections.mobile\" type=\"bool\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\" default=\"false\">\n \t\t\tLower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver support.\n \t\t</member>\n+\t\t<member name=\"rendering/reflections/specular_occlusion/enabled\" type=\"bool\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\" default=\"true\">","path":"doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml","commit_id":"56730d0cb2e4fd06c0ef23c7e44d8e9e8e64edf0","original_commit_id":"a17b656e427744672b994c4e24edafd3ffad37b5","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.git